      "revision": 1356737247,
      "text": "Tulbaghia alliacea is a geophyte belonging to the Amaryllidaceae family. The species is native to Botswana, South Africa, Zambia and Zimbabwe."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Tulbaghia alliacea",
